<title>UK: Manufacturing &quot;on the up,&quot; UK Treasury says.</title>
<headline>Manufacturing &quot;on the up,&quot; UK Treasury says.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK Treasury said the fall in August manufacturing output followed a strong performance in July and business surveys suggest manufacturing output is &quot;on the up.&quot;  </p>
<p>DATA SHOWED</p>
<p>===========</p>
<p>UK AUG INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT -0.4% MM UNCH% YY, MANUFACTURING -0.3% MM, -0.9% YY</p>
<p>UK MANUFACTURING OUTPUT +0.1% IN 3 MTHS TO AUGUST VS PVS 3, -0.4% VS YR AGO</p>
</text>
